{"seq":1,"slug":"token-component-integration","title":"Token 与组件的集成策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems/implementation/token-component-integration","wordCount":852,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"token-与组件的集成策略\">Token 与组件的集成策略</h1><p>Design Token 是设计系统的&quot;数据库&quot;，组件是它的&quot;应用层&quot;。两者之间的集成方式决定了主题切换的灵活性、token 变更的传播效率、以及多品牌支持的工程复杂度。2026 年，Tailwind CSS v4 的 CSS 变量原生支持和 W3C Design Tokens 规范的成熟使这一集成达到了新的简洁度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Token-组件集成的本质问题是：如何让组件的视觉表现&quot;响应&quot;token 值的变化，同时保持运行时零成本或近零成本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 设计工具&#10;        F[Figma Variables]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Token 管线&#10;        J[tokens.json W3C格式] --&gt; SD[Style Dictionary]&#10;        SD --&gt; CSS[CSS Custom Properties]&#10;        SD --&gt; TW[Tailwind Config]&#10;        SD --&gt; NV[Native Variables]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 组件消费&#10;        CSS --&gt; C[组件通过 var 引用]&#10;        TW --&gt; C&#10;    end&#10;    F --&gt; J\">graph LR\n    subgraph 设计工具\n        F[Figma Variables]\n    end\n    subgraph Token 管线\n        J[tokens.json W3C格式] --&gt; SD[Style Dictionary]\n        SD --&gt; CSS[CSS Custom Properties]\n        SD --&gt; TW[Tailwind Config]\n        SD --&gt; NV[Native Variables]\n    end\n    subgraph 组件消费\n        CSS --&gt; C[组件通过 var 引用]\n        TW --&gt; C\n    end\n    F --&gt; J</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>集成策略</th>\n<th>运行时开销</th>\n<th>主题切换方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CSS Custom Properties</td>\n<td>零（浏览器原生）</td>\n<td>切换 class/attribute</td>\n<td>Web 全场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tailwind 语义 class</td>\n<td>零（编译时解析）</td>\n<td>CSS 变量 + dark mode</td>\n<td>Tailwind 项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CSS-in-JS runtime</td>\n<td>中（JS 计算）</td>\n<td>Context/Provider</td>\n<td>需要 JS 逻辑控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Static extraction</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>构建时生成多份 CSS</td>\n<td>极致性能需求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"css-custom-properties-基石方案\">CSS Custom Properties：基石方案</h2><p>CSS 变量是 2026 年 token-组件集成的绝对主流。其优势在于浏览器原生支持、零运行时开销、且支持运行时动态切换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* Token 层输出 */&#10;:root {&#10;  --color-primary: #3b82f6;&#10;  --color-primary-foreground: #ffffff;&#10;  --radius-md: 0.375rem;&#10;  --spacing-3: 0.75rem;&#10;  --spacing-4: 1rem;&#10;}&#10;&#10;[data-theme=&#39;dark&#39;] {&#10;  --color-primary: #60a5fa;&#10;  --color-primary-foreground: #0f172a;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 组件层消费 */&#10;.button-primary {&#10;  background-color: var(--color-primary);&#10;  color: var(--color-primary-foreground);&#10;  border-radius: var(--radius-md);&#10;  padding: var(--spacing-3) var(--spacing-4);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* Token 层输出 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:root</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --color-primary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">#3b82f6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --color-primary-foreground</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">#ffffff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --radius-md</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.375</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --spacing-3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.75</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --spacing-4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">data-theme</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dark'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --color-primary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">#60a5fa</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --color-primary-foreground</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">#0f172a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 组件层消费 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.button-primary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  background-color</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--color-primary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  color</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--color-primary-foreground</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  border-radius</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--radius-md</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--spacing-3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--spacing-4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>主题切换只需在根元素上改变 <code>data-theme</code> 属性，所有组件通过 CSS 变量继承链自动响应——无需 JavaScript 介入，无需重新渲染。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tailwind-css-v4-的-token-原生支持\">Tailwind CSS v4 的 Token 原生支持</h2><p>Tailwind v4（2025 年发布）将 CSS 变量提升为一等公民。配置文件从 JavaScript 迁移到 CSS，token 直接定义为 <code>@theme</code> 指令：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* app.css — Tailwind v4 的 token 定义 */&#10;@import &#39;tailwindcss&#39;;&#10;&#10;@theme {&#10;  --color-primary: oklch(0.65 0.25 264);&#10;  --color-primary-foreground: oklch(0.98 0 0);&#10;  --color-destructive: oklch(0.55 0.22 29);&#10;  --radius-sm: 0.25rem;&#10;  --radius-md: 0.375rem;&#10;  --radius-lg: 0.5rem;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* app.css — Tailwind v4 的 token 定义 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@import</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'tailwindcss'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@theme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  --color-primary: oklch(0</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.65</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 264);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  --color-primary-foreground: oklch(0</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.98</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 0 0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  --color-destructive: oklch(0</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.55</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.22</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 29);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  --radius-sm: 0.25rem;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  --radius-md: 0.375rem;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  --radius-lg: 0.5rem;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>组件直接使用语义化的 Tailwind class：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function Button({ variant = &#39;primary&#39;, children }) {&#10;  return &lt;button className=&quot;bg-primary text-primary-foreground rounded-md px-4 py-2&quot;&gt;{children}&lt;/button&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function Button({ variant = 'primary', children }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;button className=\"bg-primary text-primary-foreground rounded-md px-4 py-2\">{children}&#x3C;/button>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种方式的优势：token 变更只需修改 CSS 文件，Tailwind 的 JIT 编译器自动将新值传播到所有使用相应 class 的组件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"shadcn-ui-的-token-集成模式\">shadcn/ui 的 Token 集成模式</h2><p>shadcn/ui 建立了一套事实标准的 token 命名约定，被大量设计系统采用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\":root {&#10;  --background: 0 0% 100%;&#10;  --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;&#10;  --primary: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;&#10;  --primary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;&#10;  --secondary: 210 40% 96.1%;&#10;  --muted: 210 40% 96.1%;&#10;  --muted-foreground: 215.4 16.3% 46.9%;&#10;  --accent: 210 40% 96.1%;&#10;  --border: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;&#10;  --ring: 222.2 84% 4.9%;&#10;  --radius: 0.5rem;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:root</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --foreground</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">222.2</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 84</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4.9</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --primary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">222.2</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 47.4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 11.2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --primary-foreground</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">210</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 40</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 98</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --secondary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">210</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 40</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 96.1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --muted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">210</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 40</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 96.1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --muted-foreground</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">215.4</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 16.3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 46.9</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --accent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">210</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 40</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 96.1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --border</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">214.3</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 31.8</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 91.4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --ring</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">222.2</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 84</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4.9</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --radius</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这套约定的设计哲学：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>HSL 分离</strong>：颜色存储为 HSL 三个值（不含 <code>hsl()</code> 函数），允许运行时调整 opacity</li>\n<li><strong>语义命名</strong>：<code>background</code>、<code>foreground</code>、<code>primary</code> 而非 <code>blue-500</code></li>\n<li><strong>Foreground 配对</strong>：每个背景色都有对应的前景色，保证对比度</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"多品牌-token-架构\">多品牌 Token 架构</h2><p>当设计系统需要服务多个品牌（白标产品、子品牌），token 架构需要额外的抽象层：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 全局 Token&#10;        G[global.tokens.json]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 品牌 Token&#10;        B1[brand-a.tokens.json]&#10;        B2[brand-b.tokens.json]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 组件 Token&#10;        C[component.tokens.json]&#10;    end&#10;    G --&gt; B1&#10;    G --&gt; B2&#10;    B1 --&gt; C&#10;    B2 --&gt; C\">graph TD\n    subgraph 全局 Token\n        G[global.tokens.json]\n    end\n    subgraph 品牌 Token\n        B1[brand-a.tokens.json]\n        B2[brand-b.tokens.json]\n    end\n    subgraph 组件 Token\n        C[component.tokens.json]\n    end\n    G --&gt; B1\n    G --&gt; B2\n    B1 --&gt; C\n    B2 --&gt; C</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>变更频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Global</td>\n<td><code>space-4: 16px</code>, <code>radius-md: 6px</code></td>\n<td>极低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Brand</td>\n<td><code>color-primary: {blue-600}</code> vs <code>color-primary: {green-600}</code></td>\n<td>低（品牌更新）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Component</td>\n<td><code>button-bg: {color-primary}</code></td>\n<td>中（组件演进）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>构建时，不同品牌的 token 文件通过 Style Dictionary 等工具编译为各自的 CSS 变量集，组件代码完全共享。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能考量-变量数量与浏览器开销\">性能考量：变量数量与浏览器开销</h2><p>CSS 变量虽然运行时&quot;零成本&quot;，但大量变量确实有内存和样式计算影响：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>变量查找时间</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>DOM 深度</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{变量查找时间} \\approx O(\\log n) \\times \\text{DOM 深度}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">变量查找时间</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DOM </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">深度</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实践建议：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>控制全局变量在 100-200 个以内</li>\n<li>组件级 token 使用 scope 限制（定义在组件根元素而非 <code>:root</code>）</li>\n<li>避免多层 alias 嵌套超过 3 级</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CSS Custom Properties 是 2026 年 token-组件集成的基石方案</li>\n<li>Tailwind v4 的 <code>@theme</code> 原生支持 CSS 变量，消除了配置割裂</li>\n<li>shadcn/ui 的 HSL 分离 + 语义命名约定成为行业事实标准</li>\n<li>多品牌场景通过 Global → Brand → Component 三层 token 架构解决</li>\n<li>变量数量控制在合理范围内（100-200 全局变量）以避免性能退化</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../../frontend-design-tokens-systems/pipeline/token-formats\">Token 格式与构建转换</a> — W3C 格式到 CSS/Tailwind 的转换管线</li>\n<li><a href=\"component-api-design\">组件 API 设计与组合模式</a> — Token 集成后的组件 API 层设计</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../frontend-design-tokens-systems/structure/theming-modes\">主题模式与暗色方案</a> — 多主题切换的 token 架构</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Token 与组件的集成策略","id":"token-与组件的集成策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CSS Custom Properties：基石方案","id":"css-custom-properties-基石方案"},{"level":2,"text":"Tailwind CSS v4 的 Token 原生支持","id":"tailwind-css-v4-的-token-原生支持"},{"level":2,"text":"shadcn/ui 的 Token 集成模式","id":"shadcn-ui-的-token-集成模式"},{"level":2,"text":"多品牌 Token 架构","id":"多品牌-token-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"性能考量：变量数量与浏览器开销","id":"性能考量-变量数量与浏览器开销"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Headless 组件原语选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems/foundations/headless-primitives"},"next":{"title":"组件 API 设计与组合模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems/implementation/component-api-design"}}